222
00:20:47,280 --> 00:20:50,040
It is also the color of most growing plants.

223
00:20:50,920 --> 00:20:55,420
Sometimes the word green means young, fresh and growing.

224
00:20:56,260 --> 00:21:00,200
Sometimes it describes something that is not yet ripe or finished.

225
00:21:00,960 --> 00:21:07,280
For example, a greenhorn is someone who has no experience, who is new to a

226
