235
00:21:50,900 --> 00:21:55,940
It describes the unpleasant feeling a person has when someone has something he

236
00:21:55,940 --> 00:22:02,340
wants. A young man may suffer from the green -eyed monster if his girlfriend begins

237
00:22:02,340 --> 00:22:04,000
going out with someone else.

238
00:22:04,640 --> 00:22:10,000
Or that green -eyed monster may affect your friend if you get a pay raise and she

